# Scratch review/working diffs at the repo root only (v0.9 Item D,
# docs/DECISIONS.md) — root-anchored so a legitimate .diff/.patch fixture
# elsewhere in the tree is unaffected. Review diffs belong in the
# gitignored .review/ directory instead (see CLAUDE.md).
/*.diff
/*.diff,
/*.patch
/.review/
